
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Doctor Application Approved</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f7fa; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
        style="background-color: #f5f7fa; padding: 40px 15px;">

        <tr>
            <td align="center">

                <!-- Email Container -->
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    style="max-width: 500px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">

                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 28px 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">
                            <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #111827; font-size: 22px;">
                                Doctor Application Approved 🎉
                            </h2>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Content -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 30px;">

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                We are pleased to inform you that your doctor application
                                has been <strong>successfully approved</strong>.
                            </p>

                            <!-- Approval Message -->
                            <div style="
                                margin: 25px 0;
                                padding: 20px;
                                background-color: #f3f4f6;
                                border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                                border-radius: 6px;
                            ">

                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0 0 15px;
                                    color: #111827;
                                    font-size: 17px;
                                    font-weight: bold;
                                    text-align: center;
                                ">
                                    Application Approved ✓
                                </p>

                                <!-- Doctor Information -->
                                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #6b7280;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                            width: 45%;
                                        ">
                                            Doctor Name
                                        </td>

                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #111827;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                            font-weight: bold;
                                        ">
                                            <%= name %>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #6b7280;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                        ">
                                            Specialization
                                        </td>

                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #111827;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                            font-weight: bold;
                                        ">
                                            <%= specialization %>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #6b7280;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                        ">
                                            License Number
                                        </td>

                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #111827;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                            font-weight: bold;
                                        ">
                                            <%= licenseNumber %>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #6b7280;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                        ">
                                            Approval Date
                                        </td>

                                        <td style="
                                            padding: 8px 0;
                                            color: #111827;
                                            font-size: 14px;
                                            font-weight: bold;
                                        ">
                                            <%= approvalDate %>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                </table>

                            </div>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                Your doctor profile is now approved and you can access
                                the available features of our healthcare platform.
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0;
                                color: #6b7280;
                                font-size: 13px;
                                line-height: 1.5;
                            ">
                                If you have any questions or need assistance, please
                                contact our support team.
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 25px 0 0;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 14px;
                                line-height: 1.5;
                            ">
                                Congratulations, and welcome to our healthcare platform.
                                We look forward to having you as part of our medical community.
                            </p>

                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="
                            padding: 20px 30px;
                            background-color: #fafafa;
                            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                            text-align: center;
                        ">
                            <p style="
                                margin: 0;
                                color: #9ca3af;
                                font-size: 12px;
                            ">
                                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

            </td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</body>
</html>

